# Reviewer requests per area. GitHub reads this file from the base branch when
# a non-draft pull request is opened (or a draft is marked ready for review)
# and requests a review from the owners of every changed file, except the PR
# author. Patterns follow .gitignore rules; the LAST matching line wins for a
# given file. Keep the area mapping in step with .github/labeler.yml.

# Backend, its tests, the socket contract, and the DTO generator pipeline.
# The generator's tests live in /tests/OpenIdle.Tests/Generators/; /tests/
# already sends them to the same owner, so they need no line of their own.
/Backend/          @frederikja163
/tests/            @frederikja163
/types.xml         @frederikja163
/Generators/       @frederikja163

# Frontend.
/Frontend/         @OliverEngbjerg

# Docker, deployment and CI. Last on purpose: Backend/Dockerfile and
# Frontend/Dockerfile go to the devops owner, not the area owner.
/deploy/           @OliverEngbjerg
/.github/          @OliverEngbjerg
**/Dockerfile*     @OliverEngbjerg
**/.dockerignore   @OliverEngbjerg
**/*compose*.y*ml  @OliverEngbjerg
